# UI design practice

Before designing or editing UI, read and follow `.cursor/skills/ui-design-practice/SKILL.md`.

Precedence, highest first:

1. The user's current request
2. WellBe guardrails, safety rules, and `docs/implementation/ui_vision.md`
3. The contracts in `docs/implementation/ui/`
4. Existing `@wellbe/ui` components and `packages/ui/src/tokens.css`
5. The direction agreed for this task
6. Any imported design skill

A spacing or copy fix stays a spacing or copy fix. A new flow starts from `.cursor/skills/ui-design-practice/brief.md`.

Use `@wellbe/ui`. Do not add a component or styling library.

Phone-width in the browser checks web layout. Native checks happen on the running `apps/mobile` app.

When the user asks for a review, follow `.cursor/skills/ui-design-review/SKILL.md` and do not edit.
